{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blast through the stars in this high-octane platformer-shooter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the space suit of a fearless astronaut on a mission to stop an alien invasion threatening the galaxy. <strong>Cosmic Tempest</strong> combines fast-paced action, tight platforming, and explosive shootouts across a variety of dynamic arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless-wave combat zones</strong> teeming with alien enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Massive boss battles</strong> that push your skills to the limit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your weapon evolves automatically as you progress \u2014 unlocking <strong>three power stages</strong> that unleash devastating firepower just when you need it most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're dodging lasers, leaping over alien-infested gaps, or holding the line against impossible odds, <strong>Cosmic Tempest</strong> delivers an adrenaline-pumping experience that keeps you coming back for one more run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced 2D platformer shooter gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bold sci-fi pixel art style and energetic soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the storm. Save the galaxy.</strong><br>Are you ready for the <strong>Cosmic Tempest</strong>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688310?t=1745651146","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688310?t=1745651146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688310/4e38007fe1417b6977a43dfdfe01490debe3b65e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745651146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688310/4e38007fe1417b6977a43dfdfe01490debe3b65e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745651146","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blast through the stars in this high-octane platformer-shooter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the space suit of a fearless astronaut on a mission to stop an alien invasion threatening the galaxy. <strong>Cosmic Tempest</strong> combines fast-paced action, tight platforming, and explosive shootouts across a variety of dynamic arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless-wave combat zones</strong> teeming with alien enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Massive boss battles</strong> that push your skills to the limit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your weapon evolves automatically as you progress \u2014 unlocking <strong>three power stages</strong> that unleash devastating firepower just when you need it most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're dodging lasers, leaping over alien-infested gaps, or holding the line against impossible odds, <strong>Cosmic Tempest</strong> delivers an adrenaline-pumping experience that keeps you coming back for one more run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced 2D platformer shooter gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bold sci-fi pixel art style and energetic soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the storm. Save the galaxy.</strong><br>Are you ready for the <strong>Cosmic Tempest</strong>?</p>","developers":["Javlier P"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description